AppNeta Intelligent Alarm (General, CRITICAL) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms rule was triggered at CRITICAL severity. This Spectrum instance
uses the general AppNeta Intelligent Alarms integration (no VNA-AppNeta path models), so the
alarm is raised on the AppNeta Intelligent Alarms model rather than on a per-path model.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

The monitored item crossed a threshold defined by the named AppNeta alarm rule, as determined
by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for that rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
